        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Giratório. Inkay se protege de inimigos fortes piscando seus pontos luminosos para desencorajá-los. Ficar de cabeça para baixo melhora sua circulação e clareia a mente, aumentando drasticamente o poder de seus golpes psíquicos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 1, Água 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Inkay pode evoluir para Malamar no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Constrict, Peck, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Reflect, Wrap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Foul Play</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Psywave, Topsy-Turvy</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Switcheroo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Light Screen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Pluck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psycho Cut</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Night Slash, Slash, Superpower</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Ally Switch, Attract, Baton Pass, Bind, Calm Mind, Confide, Dark Pulse, Double Team, Embargo, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Fake Tears, Flamethrower, Fling, Foul Play, Frustration, Future Sight, Gravity, Guard Swap, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Lash Out, Light Screen, Liquidation, Lunge, Nasty Plot, Payback, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psycho Cut, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Rock Slide, Role Play, Round, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Swift, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acupressure, Camouflage, Destiny Bond, Disable, Flatter, Guard Swap, Power Split, Simple Beam</p>",
